{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9359e958c79beeda","name":"Joker Squad Stormtrooper","source":{"id":"source:reference-9359e958c79beeda","title":"Joker Squad Stormtrooper","revision":20223,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:26:18Z","sha256":"289b56724866aab25d44a2178afbd36fac2a9e712f5fe945435b98f099e1bbde","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20223","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Joker%20Squad%20Stormtrooper&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9359e958c79beeda","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Joker Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joker_Squad","referenceId":"reference:fdb781529688c891"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A new and diverse squad of Stormtroopers, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Joker Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joker_Squad","referenceId":"reference:fdb781529688c891"}," remains loyal to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Krayt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Krayt","referenceId":"reference:c6d0b6bc88280f92"}," despite the misgivings of some of its members. A part of the 407th Stormtrooper division, which had defected to the Emperor-in-Exile, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Emperor Roan Fel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emperor_Roan_Fel"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Joker Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joker_Squad","referenceId":"reference:fdb781529688c891"}," encounters the rebellious Stormtroopers on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Borosk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Borosk?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and manages to defeat the rebels, though ",{"tag":"a","children":["Joker Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joker_Squad","referenceId":"reference:fdb781529688c891"}," is killed almost to a man. The reformed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Joker Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joker_Squad","referenceId":"reference:fdb781529688c891"}," operates under the command of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ran \"Hardcase\" Harkas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ran_%22Hardcase%22_Harkas?action=edit&redlink=1"},", who has rebuilt the squad since the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Borosk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Borosk?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Joker Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joker_Squad","referenceId":"reference:fdb781529688c891"}," is a specialized squad that employs combat engineers, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons Specialists"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joker_Squad_Heavy_Weapons_Specialists"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Demolitionists"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joker_Squad_Demolitionists"},". Though relatively young, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Joker Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joker_Squad","referenceId":"reference:fdb781529688c891"}," has embraced the mantra of the new Empire and has become one of the Stormtrooper squads most capable of handling a wide variety of missions. The individual members of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Joker Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joker_Squad","referenceId":"reference:fdb781529688c891"},", referring to themselves as \"Jokers,\" are encouraged to bring their own unique skill set and opinions to the table when planning any mission.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Joker Squad Stormtrooper Statistics (CL 3)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","chi